  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/xyproto/orbiton/zipball/v2.75.0",
  "body": "### Retro game development\r\n\r\n* Add experimental support for building+running C64, CHIP-8, DOS, GBA, NES and SNES programs.\r\n* Add initial support for LÖVE and pyxel.\r\n\r\n### Fixes\r\n\r\n* Fix an issue with globbing when searching for files.\r\n* Fix syntax highlighting for light backgrounds (like the default `xterm` theme).\r\n* Hide quick help when \"nano mode\" is enabled.\r\n\r\n### Book mode\r\n\r\n* Add an experimental book mode browser preview feature.\r\n* Improve how '<!--- comments --->' in Markdown are handled.\r\n\r\n### Performance\r\n\r\n* Add sixel performance detection.\r\n* Improve how the \"search when typing\" feature works, especially for larger files.\r\n\r\n### Look and feel\r\n\r\n* Adjust the placement of the program output box.\r\n* Improve the LSP / Tab completion behavior.\r\n* Adjust hotkeys for jumping to matching brackets.\r\n\r\n### Various\r\n\r\n* Add a termindex badge to the README.md file.\r\n* Try to play `.abc` files with fluidsynth before trying timidity.\r\n* Add initial support for Fish and Oil shell scripts.\r\n* Update documentation.\r\n* Update dependencies.\r\n\r\n"
}
